      "visual": "<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:20px;font-family:var(--font-mono, monospace)\">172.16.0.<span class=\"wt-hl\">?</span></p>"
     },
     {
      "text": "List the last numbers that are taken already.",
      "visual": "<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:20px;font-family:var(--font-mono, monospace)\">taken: <span class=\"wt-hl\">8</span> and <span class=\"wt-hl\">5</span></p>"
     },
     {
      "text": "Pick any other number from 1 to 254, like 20.",
      "visual": "<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;font-size:20px;font-family:var(--font-mono, monospace)\">172.16.0.<span class=\"wt-hl\">20</span></p>"
     },
     {
      "text": "<strong>Where a website comes from.</strong> Think of Visit a Website in the 3D lab: which device did you walk to, to find the website's address with ipconfig?",
      "visual": "<div class=\"wt-note\">the computer that keeps the website</div>"
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
