   "appId": "drill-y6-3-3-itrace",
   "embedContainerId": "y6-34-do-now-ext",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Extension: Do Now Challenge</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why practise last lesson before we learn something new?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>Today builds on websites and web servers. If you remember them, today is easier.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\"><strong>Extension:</strong> finished the Do Now? Try more questions from last lesson. Stuck? Turn on <strong>I need help</strong>.</p><div id=\"y6-34-do-now-ext\"></div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "title",
   "label": "Searching the Web",
   "content": "<div class=\"lesson-title-slide\"><p class=\"lesson-title-kicker\">6.3 Computer Networks</p><h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Searching the Web</h2><p>Year 6</p></div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li><strong>Today:</strong> how a search finds a few web pages out of millions.</li><li>Why some pages come first.</li><li>Then help customers who cannot find things, at the <strong>Network Help Desk</strong>.</li></ul><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">There are millions of web pages. Predict: how could a computer find the few pages about tigers in less than a second?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>It cannot read millions of pages each time you ask. It must get ready before you ask.</p></div></details>"
  },
  {
   "id": "concept-engine",
   "label": "What Is a Search Engine?",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">What Is a Search Engine?</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Predict: when you search for tiger, does the computer read every web page in the world, right then? Why, or why not?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>No. That would take far too long. It has already visited the pages and kept a list of their words, so it only looks in its list.</p></div></details><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li>A <strong>search engine</strong> is a website that finds web pages for you.</li><li>The words you type are your <strong>search terms</strong>.</li><li>It visits web pages all the time and keeps a <strong>list</strong> of the pages and the words on them.</li><li>When you search, it looks in its list. It does not read every page again.</li><li>It visits the pages again and again, to keep its list up to date.</li></ul></div><div><figure style=\"margin:0;text-align:center\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 270\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto\"><g><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"150\" height=\"74\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink-soft)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-3)\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"46\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Tigers: Facts</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"64\" fill=\"var(--ink-soft)\" font-size=\"12\">Tigers live in Asia.</text></g><g><rect x=\"10\" y=\"98\" width=\"150\" height=\"74\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink-soft)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"98\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-3)\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"134\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Greenhill Library</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"152\" fill=\"var(--ink-soft)\" font-size=\"12\">Open 9 am to 5 pm.</text></g><g><rect x=\"10\" y=\"186\" width=\"150\" height=\"74\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface)\" stroke=\"var(--ink-soft)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"186\" width=\"150\" height=\"18\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"var(--surface-3)\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"222\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Easy Pizza Recipe</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"240\" fill=\"var(--ink-soft)\" font-size=\"12\">Bake for 15 minutes.</text></g><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"135\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"135\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M290 127 L304 135 L290 143 Z\" fill=\"var(--brand)\"/><text x=\"235\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--brand)\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">visits pages</text><line x1=\"168\" y1=\"47\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><line x1=\"168\" y1=\"223\" x2=\"300\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><rect x=\"310\" y=\"20\" width=\"240\" height=\"230\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"var(--brand-soft)\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"430\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"800\">Its list</text><text x=\"326\" y=\"74\" fill=\"var(--brand)\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"var(--font-mono, monospace)\">tiger</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"74\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\">Tigers: Facts</text><text x=\"326\" y=\"102\" fill=\"var(--brand)\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"var(--font-mono, monospace)\">asia</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"102\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\">Tigers: Facts</text><text x=\"326\" y=\"130\" fill=\"var(--brand)\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"var(--font-mono, monospace)\">library</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"130\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\">Greenhill Library</text><text x=\"326\" y=\"158\" fill=\"var(--brand)\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"var(--font-mono, monospace)\">open</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"158\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\">Greenhill Library</text><text x=\"326\" y=\"186\" fill=\"var(--brand)\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"var(--font-mono, monospace)\">pizza</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"186\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\">Easy Pizza Recipe</text><text x=\"326\" y=\"214\" fill=\"var(--brand)\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"var(--font-mono, monospace)\">bake</text><text x=\"400\" y=\"214\" fill=\"var(--ink)\" font-size=\"14\">Easy Pizza Recipe</text></svg><figcaption style=\"font-size:15px;color:var(--muted)\">It visits web pages and keeps a list of their words</figcaption></figure></div></div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "predict-engine",
   "label": "Predict: Where Does It Look?",
   "type": "multiple-choice",
   "containerId": "y6-34-predict-engine",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Predict: Where Does It Look?</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Your school library has a computer that finds books. What would it need to know about each book?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>The book's title, the words it is about, and where it is kept.</p></div></details><div id=\"y6-34-predict-engine\"></div>",
   "items": [
    {
     "prompt": "You search for pizza. Where does the search engine look?",
     "options": [
      "At every web page, one by one, right then",
      "In its list of web pages and their words",
      "Inside your own laptop"
     ],
     "correct": 1,
     "explain": "It looks in its list. It made the list before you asked, so the search is fast."
    },
    {
     "prompt": "A new web page about pandas went online one minute ago. Why might a search not find it yet?",
     "options": [
      "The search engine has not visited it, so it is not in the list",
      "Web pages about pandas are not allowed",
      "The internet is too full today"
     ],
     "correct": 0,
     "explain": "The search engine only finds pages in its list. It adds a new page when it visits it."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "concept-rank",
   "label": "Best Match First",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Best Match First</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Predict: you search for zoo ticket. One page has both words. One has only one of them. Which should come first, and why?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>The page with both words. It matches more of what you asked for.</p></div></details><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li>The search engine finds every page in its list that has your search terms.</li><li>Then it puts them in order, best match first. This is called <strong>ranking</strong>. The page at the top is ranked 1st.</li><li>Pages with <strong>more</strong> of your search terms come first.</li><li>If two pages have the same number, a search term in the <strong>title</strong> counts more than one in the text.</li></ul></div><div><figure style=\"margin:0\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;background:var(--surface-3);border-radius:10px;padding:5px 10px\"><b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">Seekit</b><span style=\"flex:1;background:var(--surface);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;font-weight:600\">zoo ticket</span></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">1</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\">Greenhill <mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Zoo:</mark> <mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Tickets</mark> and Opening Times</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.greenhill-zoo.example</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">The <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">zoo</mark> is open from 8 am to 6 pm every day. A child <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">ticket</mark> costs 100 baht.</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">2</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\">Greenhill Swimming Pool: <mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Ticket</mark> Prices</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.greenhill-pool.example</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">A child <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">ticket</mark> costs 40 baht. An adult <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">ticket</mark> costs 80 baht. The pool is open from 7 am to 7 pm.</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">3</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\">Greenhill Bus Times</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.greenhill-buses.example</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">The number 5 bus goes to the <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">zoo</mark> every 20 minutes. The number 8 bus goes to the pool every 30 minutes.</div></div><figcaption style=\"font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center\">Search terms marked: blue in a title, yellow in the text</figcaption></figure></div></div>"
  },
  {
   "id": "predict-rank",
   "label": "Predict: Which Is Ranked 1st?",
   "type": "multiple-choice",
   "containerId": "y6-34-predict-rank",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Predict: Which Is Ranked 1st?</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why does a search engine put the best match at the top, and not at the bottom?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>Most people only read the first few results. The page they want should be where they look first.</p></div></details><div class=\"igame-two-col\"><div><figure style=\"margin:0\"><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">?</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\"><mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Football</mark> Training for Children</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.greenhill-football.example/kids</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\"><mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Football</mark> training for children is on Wednesday at 4 pm. Bring a water bottle.</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">?</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\">Swimming Lessons for Children</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.greenhill-pool.example/lessons</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">Swimming lessons for children are on <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Saturday</mark> at 10 am at the Greenhill pool.</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">?</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\">Greenhill <mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Football</mark> Club: Results</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.greenhill-football.example</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">Greenhill won 3 to 1 on <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Saturday.</mark> The next match is at home.</div></div><figcaption style=\"font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);text-align:center\">Search: <b>football saturday</b>. Not in rank order.</figcaption></figure></div><div id=\"y6-34-predict-rank\"></div></div>",
   "items": [
    {
     "prompt": "Which page will be ranked 1st?",
     "options": [
      "Football Training for Children",
      "Swimming Lessons for Children",
      "Greenhill Football Club: Results"
     ],
     "correct": 2,
     "explain": "Greenhill Football Club: Results has both search terms: football and Saturday."
    },
    {
