  {
   "id": "activity-1",
   "label": "Activity 1: Predict the Top Result",
   "type": "embedded-app",
   "appId": "search-engine-lab",
   "embedContainerId": "y6-34-activity-1",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Activity 1: Predict the Top Result</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why predict before you see the ranking?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>You find out if you really know the rules, and do not only watch.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\"><strong>About 5 minutes.</strong> Read the search terms and the three pages. Click the page you predict will be ranked 1st. Get 3 right in a row.</p><div id=\"y6-34-activity-1\"></div>",
   "embedQuery": "part=1"
  },
  {
   "id": "concept-terms",
   "label": "Clear Search Terms",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Clear Search Terms</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Look at the two searches. Ana wants to fix her computer mouse. Predict: which search is better for her, and why?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>fix mouse. The word mouse alone has two meanings, an animal and a computer mouse, so the animal page comes first.</p></div></details><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li><strong>Clear search terms</strong> are a few key words that the page you want has.</li><li>Leave out small words like how, the, is and I. Almost every page has them, so they do not help.</li><li>Spell them right. No page has the word libary.</li><li>A word with two meanings needs one more word: mouse, or fix mouse?</li></ul></div><div><figure style=\"margin:0\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;background:var(--surface-3);border-radius:10px;padding:5px 10px\"><b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">Seekit</b><span style=\"flex:1;background:var(--surface);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;font-weight:600\">mouse</span></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">1</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\">House <mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Mouse:</mark> Animal Facts</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.animal-facts.example/mouse</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">A house <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">mouse</mark> is about 8 cm long. It eats seeds and can jump 30 cm high.</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">2</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\">Computer <mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Mouse:</mark> Buy Online</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.tech-shop.example/mouse</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">A computer <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">mouse</mark> with no cable costs 350 baht. It works with any laptop.</div></div></figure><figure style=\"margin:0\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;background:var(--surface-3);border-radius:10px;padding:5px 10px\"><b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">Seekit</b><span style=\"flex:1;background:var(--surface);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;font-weight:600\">fix mouse</span></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">1</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\"><mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Fix</mark> a Computer <mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Mouse</mark> That Stops Working</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.tech-shop.example/help</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">If your computer <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">mouse</mark> stops working, put in new batteries first. Then clean the light under the <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">mouse.</mark></div></div></figure></div></div>"
  },
