   "type": "multiple-choice",
   "containerId": "y6-34-predict-terms",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Predict: Which Search?</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">A friend types a whole long sentence into a search engine. Why might it still work some of the time?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>The search engine leaves out the small words. The key words that are left may be enough.</p></div></details><div id=\"y6-34-predict-terms\"></div>",
