  {
   "id": "activity-2",
   "label": "Activity 2: Find It, Then Fix the Search",
   "type": "embedded-app",
   "appId": "search-engine-lab",
   "embedContainerId": "y6-34-activity-2",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Activity 2: Find It, Then Fix the Search</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why is a wrong page a mistake, even if you find the right one later?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>Reading the titles first saves time. A good searcher picks the right page the first time.</p></div></details><p class=\"lesson-lead\"><strong>About 6 minutes.</strong> Find It: type clear search terms, open the page that answers the question, then type the answer. Then Fix the Search: say what is wrong with a search, and type a better one. 3 in a row for each.</p><div id=\"y6-34-activity-2\"></div>",
   "embedQuery": "part=2"
  },
  {
   "id": "check-search",
   "label": "Check: Read and Search",
   "type": "short-answer-validation",
   "validatorId": "y6-34-check-search",
   "validatorKey": "y6_34_check_search",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Check: Read and Search</h2><details class=\"lesson-tps\"><summary><span class=\"lesson-tps-steps\">Think <b>&rarr;</b> Pair <b>&rarr;</b> Share</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-q\">Why might a page be ranked lower even when it has a word you typed?</span><span class=\"lesson-tps-reveal\">Show the answer</span></summary><div class=\"lesson-tps-a\"><p>Other pages may have more of your search terms, or have them in the title.</p></div></details><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><figure style=\"margin:0\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;background:var(--surface-3);border-radius:10px;padding:5px 10px\"><b style=\"color:var(--brand)\">Seekit</b><span style=\"flex:1;background:var(--surface);border-radius:8px;padding:2px 8px;font-weight:600\">greenhill zoo ticket</span></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">1</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\"><mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Greenhill</mark> <mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Zoo:</mark> <mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Tickets</mark> and Opening Times</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.greenhill-zoo.example</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">The <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">zoo</mark> is open from 8 am to 6 pm every day. A child <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">ticket</mark> costs 100 baht.</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">2</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\"><mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Greenhill</mark> Swimming Pool: <mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Ticket</mark> Prices</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.greenhill-pool.example</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">A child <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">ticket</mark> costs 40 baht. An adult <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">ticket</mark> costs 80 baht. The pool is open from 7 am to 7 pm.</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:4px 8px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:28px 1fr;gap:0 8px;margin:5px 0;background:var(--surface);text-align:left\"><div style=\"grid-row:1 / span 3;font:800 20px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--brand);align-self:center;text-align:center\">3</div><div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:15px\"><mark style=\"background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--brand) 25%, transparent);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">Greenhill</mark> Bus Times</div><div style=\"font:12px var(--font-mono, monospace);color:var(--good)\">www.greenhill-buses.example</div><div style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--ink-soft)\">The number 5 bus goes to the <mark style=\"background:var(--warn-soft);color:inherit;font-weight:700;border-radius:3px;padding:0 2px\">zoo</mark> every 20 minutes. The number 8 bus goes to the pool every 30 minutes.</div></div></figure></div><div><div class=\"lesson-exam-card\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-responses\"><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y6-34-check-search-a\">What rank is the page Greenhill Bus Times? Type a number.</label><input id=\"y6-34-check-search-a\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-search-a\" aria-label=\"Check: Read and Search part a\" autocomplete=\"off\" inputmode=\"decimal\"></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-response\"><label for=\"y6-34-check-search-b\">Type clear search terms to find when Greenhill Zoo opens. Use at most 4 words.</label><input id=\"y6-34-check-search-b\" class=\"pseudocode-output-input lesson-exam-answer\" data-answer-kind=\"short\" data-answer-id=\"check-search-b\" aria-label=\"Check: Read and Search part b\" autocomplete=\"off\"></div></div><div class=\"lesson-do-now-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"donow-btn\" id=\"y6-34-check-search-check\">Check answers</button><strong>Total: 2 marks</strong></div><div id=\"y6-34-check-search-feedback\" class=\"pseudocode-feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div></div></div></div>"
